--- CANDIDATE ANSWER ---
Set the package-level option before executing commands:

```go
cobra.EnablePrefixMatching = true
```

Evidence: `cobra.go:55` defines `EnablePrefixMatching`. In `command.go:767-786`, `findNext` accepts a prefix only when that flag is true and only when exactly one command matches. Prefixes apply to command names and aliases via `hasNameOrAliasPrefix` in `command.go:1524-1538`.
